{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，過完年第三學期也開始了。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0670", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好睏。」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0671", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太非常簡單扼要地說明了現狀。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然每天都因為社團而來學校，但是假期還是會讓人腦袋變遲鈍。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……新吾，你過年期間有發生什麼好事嗎？」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0672", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還可以啦。隼太呢？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「完～全沒有。照樣睡覺度過。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0673", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以是和以前一樣和平的過年假期啊。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也可以這麼說吧。人啊，到了一定年紀後就不會追求刺激變化了……」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0674", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你悟道了啊。」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你倒是交到可愛的女朋友，每天都有新變化吧～？」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0675", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就叫你不要看遠方了。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0676", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，今年也請多指教囉！」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，我才是要請你多多指教了。」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "ht0677", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，３年級是自由出席啊……這樣一來跟美羽學姊見面的機會就減少了……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1601", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個時期，也是沒辦法的啊。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不會寂寞嗎？平常見不到學姊……」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1602", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有那麼寂寞吧。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇，你已經勾搭上其他女人了嗎？」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1603", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼要往那方面猜？」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是思考過你的人性後才做出的判斷。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1604", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新學期才剛開始，就重溫紗凪的毒舌了。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的確在學校裡跟學姊相處的機會減少了，但是相對的，我們在其他地方見面補足。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且雖然是自由出席，但放學後推開這扇門的話──", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，兩位都辛苦了～」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2067", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "pn0404", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能看到這個笑容，還說寂寞就太失禮了。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……如果是美羽學姊的話被她抱也可以。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1605", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「帶著那個笑容，做那～種事或這～種事……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1606", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身為實際被那個這個過的人，老實說我實在不推薦。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被寵成那樣，會讓日常生活產生障礙的。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是被她那樣笑著說「再射多一點出來」之類的話……不對，已經有被說過，真的好像要瘋狂了。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾君，可以出來了嗎？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2068", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸欸！？」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2069", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快點把這個籠子搬出來啦。你過了這麼久還是渣蟲欸。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1607", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，籠子啊，好。」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是這種感覺，要回歸社會非常困難。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很危險的小熊喵，不要靠近喔～」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2070", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "pn0405", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，乖孩子乖孩子♪」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2071", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，我也要加油讓學姊說我是乖孩子！", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要搬出來的不是那個籠子啦，渣蟲。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "sn1608", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……距離好孩子的目標還好遙遠。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，你又再忍耐了吧？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2072", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、呃……」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好吧。既然你這麼固執……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2073", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啊、啊啊！？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2074", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……又射了好多出來呢。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2075", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕、學姊……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乖孩子乖孩子……」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2076", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……明明沒有努力，卻被說是乖孩子了。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感覺今天連５分鐘都沒有撐住。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再加油一點吧我。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是說，一天比一天更厲害的學姊好可怕。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不要亂動喔，我拿衛生紙幫你擦掉。」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2077", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、不好意思……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊真的很會照顧人。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只幫我剪指甲掏耳朵，甚至還幫我穿襪子。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，房間的衛生紙用完了……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2078", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有袖珍包衛生紙，用那個擦吧。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2079", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那今天就這樣……」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2080", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊姆、啾、嗯嗯、啾唔、啾、嗯嗯、啾唔唔……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 285, "voice": "mu2081", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、學姊……嘴巴……啊啊、啊啊啊啊！？」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如今那個美羽學姊，居然「用嘴舔乾淨」這種招式都學會了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這麼幸福真的可以嗎？", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊在社團和兩人獨處的時候的落差真的太驚人了。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都不知道美羽學姊的這一面吧……", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一想到這點，我不禁嘿嘿笑起來。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕……嚕……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "？？？", "alt_speaker_idx": 298, "voice": "pn0406", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剛才那是熊喵的叫聲？", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這麼晚了發生什麼事了？", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒有再聽到聲音了，是我的錯覺嗎？", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之早點回去吧，櫻乃會擔心的……", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕……」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "pn0407", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_23.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕……嗚嚕……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 281, "voice": "pn0408", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
